	(text "(check):\n- ST's application hint asks for 100 nF plus 10 uF bulk near pin 9. The 10 uF here is BUCK1's output cap C207\n  on the power sheet; place U401 close to it or add a 10 uF on VDD_1V8 near U401 in layout.\n- Footprint: KiCad Package_LGA:LGA-12_2x2mm_P0.5mm. Compare pad 1 position and pad sizes with ST's land pattern\n  (TN0018) before layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2e43c936-8d46-4cde-91be-de9e76c780a2")
	)
	(text "- VDD (pin 9) and VDD_IO (pin 10) on VDD_1V8; C401 at pin 9 (VDD), C402 at pin 10 (VDD_IO).\n- CS (pin 2) tied to VDD_1V8: I2C mode (SPI disabled).\n- SDO/SA0 (pin 3) tied to VDD_1V8: I2C address 0011001b = 0x19 (0x18 if SA0 were low).\n  CS and SA0 also have internal pull-ups (about 49k at 1.8 V); the hard strap avoids depending on them.\n- SDA/SCL on I2C_SDA/I2C_SCL. No pull-ups here: R203/R204 on the power sheet serve the whole bus.\n- INT1 -> ACC_INT1 (SoC wake GPIO P1.07). INT2 -> ACC_INT2, test pad TP401 only.\n- Pin 5 NC: datasheet allows VDD, VDD_IO or GND; tied to GND. Pin 7 RES: connect to GND (datasheet).\n- Pins 6 and 8 GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "490735e9-6899-4831-a2d4-e5c6032e700c")
	)
	(text "Sensors sheet (step 5): ST LIS2DW12 on the shared 1.8 V I2C bus. Pinout from ST datasheet DocID029682 Rev 4, table 2."
